<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib10.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Transactions of the Association for Computational Linguistics</em>, 2024.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib11" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Su et al. [2024]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Jiangjie Su et al.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Language models as lossy compressors.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib11.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics</em>, 2024.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib12" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Vasilatos et al. [2024]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Emmanouil Vasilatos et al.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Bayesian uncertainty decomposition for hallucination detection.

