<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Results remain robust across reasonable parameter ranges. The conditional independence audit shows MI(<math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{A}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math>) = 0.0032 nats (permutation test p=0.71).</p>
</div>
</section>
